{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bbb57a2bdcdd36cdf68bccb4d7f50f8611148c96d5c2077e4d53848ffc19c194", "ja": "（今日は『アイグラ！！』新企画の撮影だ。\n順調に前半を撮り終えたジュリアは、休憩に入った）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄《偶像写真！！》的新企划。顺利拍完前半部分的茱莉亚进入了休息时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b7bd9a6e19d37150e55e0cd1caa44957daf608a283de4eeb4f838c934a90620", "ja": "ふふふふ～ん♪", "zh": "哼哼哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bf691a4be2949513330f37fc3d0ae04fe3f775986da878de2ef77e9b8262b731", "ja": "ジュリア、機嫌が良さそうだな。\nちょっと安心したよ。", "zh": "茱莉亚，看起来心情不错嘛。\n我也稍微放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "36689a2730b48f3ac793360a6f458b6497cc553c357ec43c4d353e4c8b1fdbd9", "ja": "安心ってなんだよ。なんか心配してたのか？\nま、この衣装を見せられた時は、驚いたけどな！", "zh": "放心是几个意思啊。你在瞎操什么心吗？\n不过，刚看到这套服装的时候，确实吓了一跳就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "9151a99643c274cad016810bc5fae3fa8e1cd6655c66bb00773f66dfe0540ac7", "ja": "あ、そうだ。{$P$}、\n何か書くもの持ってないか？", "zh": "啊，对了。{$P$}，\n你有没有带什么能写字的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dfb853a37558ba6f6914c902a97610eb14e50f8b5e4394b7abdca291ca96a788", "ja": "え？　ああ、ボールペンで良ければ。\n……何に使うんだ？", "zh": "诶？啊，圆珠笔可以吗？\n……你要用来做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "af5e8e7499bbdb7ad0fd2c643750656a4dcc956d31e595c2431dbe01a8bc20d2", "ja": "今、いいフレーズを思いついたんだ。\n忘れないうちに書いておこうと思ってさ。", "zh": "我刚才想到了很棒的旋律。想趁还没忘记，先把它写下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c422fd8c4dedd388939647f4735eb8db929ba5b5240a60784b8be689f57c995f", "ja": "……ああ、さっきの鼻歌はそれか。\nなんだ、機嫌がいいってわけじゃなかったのか。", "zh": "……啊，刚才哼的歌原来是这个啊。\n害我想着，还以为你心情很好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "532644b5710de51d77c928f5d2eab44a2010fc80737a1e9e696073636a23c4bb", "ja": "いや、機嫌もいいけど？　どういうわけか、\nさっきからポンポンフレーズが降りてくるんだよ。", "zh": "没有啊，我心情也挺好的？不知道为什么，\n从刚才起乐句就一个接一个地浮现出来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "12ca1b378eea77be9fe74572b9bbea2545b669dcaae97462bc2faf1bba47438d", "ja": "まあ……もしかしたら、この衣装のおかげなのかもな。\nいつも着ない服だから、感覚が新鮮っつーか♪", "zh": "嗯……说不定是因为这套服装吧。毕竟是平时不会穿的衣服，感觉挺新鲜的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1010_p", "source_sha256": "25dafe259b2cd01906766f1e8cc952a50193b0306d591bfdce329905214fb5cf", "ja": "へえ……それは予想外だな。その衣装で、ジュリアの\n新しい一面を引き出せる、とは思っていたけど……。", "zh": "哦……那还真是出乎意料。我本来只是觉得，这套服装或许能展现出茱莉亚不为人知的一面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1011_p", "source_sha256": "456a75628c374dabafe31d2319f547549bae25269e70474a698044228f8f27fb", "ja": "まさか創作意欲を刺激するとは思わなかった。\nさすがジュリアだな！", "zh": "没想到竟然还能激发创作欲。真不愧是茱莉亚啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "e1a7332d338ebcebd471c80ebebdf5c953339289cd0d42bbc402f072ea9c2603", "ja": "あははっ、そこは自分をホメていいんじゃないか？\nあんたのおかげなんだからさ♪", "zh": "啊哈哈，这方面你可以夸夸自己吧？\n毕竟都是多亏了你嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "0ed16878caa55ad92270b67ef322cca5cd03053fa609203223ed7ad178b2030b", "ja": "それに、フレーズとか抜きにしても……\nまあ、こういう服も、たまにはいいかなって思ったし。", "zh": "而且，就算不提那句台词……嗯，我觉得这种衣服偶尔穿穿也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "cba8ec0bcd05034323a38e8ac128aa697f14243f3bb04abf8b54dae14c82dde5", "ja": "あ、いっとくけど「たまには」だぞ？\nあくまでも「たまには」だからな！？", "zh": "啊，先说好，是“偶尔”哦？\n仅仅是“偶尔”而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1015_p", "source_sha256": "be427f0f1e0a13e5acd4269bcc5e36ea0e2e02a3224594a90c908d58aaf7f3ed", "ja": "わかってるって。\nこれからも「たまに」よろしく頼むぞ！", "zh": "我知道啦。\n今后“偶尔”也拜托你了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "da54c2fcd7aee23a38527411ea0d357241c5bef2753df21d5ccfc33669a9d98b", "ja": "ホントにわかってんだろうな、ったく……。\nっと、もう休憩終わりか。ボールペン、サンキュ。", "zh": "你真的明白了吧，真是的……  \n啊，休息时间已经结束了吗。圆珠笔，谢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c047d36cb25f51991af58a894d40db0216c6fa307140cce17b525cea11891308", "ja": "ああ、まずは残りの撮影をよろしく！\n……お、短い休憩の間に、けっこう書いたんだな。", "zh": "啊，首先，剩下的拍摄就拜托你了！\n……哦，趁着短暂的休息时间，已经写了不少了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "49e61a89b3e0040b180b09779fed4e920098bd9658bac039ee4034c9a0585def", "ja": "ば、ばか！　見るな！\nまだ途中なんだから！　ったく……。", "zh": "笨、笨蛋！不许看！\n还没写完呢！真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "0ccf4367e0c1b08c0d1637686c5956ddfb7fac5494a9d63bfd6b44b4b6ccd856", "ja": "全部できたら、ちゃんと見せてやるからさ。\n今はあたしのワンピ姿でも、しっかり見ときな！", "zh": "等全部弄好了，我会好好给你看的。  \n现在就先好好看看我穿连衣裙的样子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e73ea37b187720fb86c85cab887c4381417a6d46ad5c2614bae14a233dd0c4b0", "ja": "そうか……そうだな。貴重な機会だろうし、\nしっかり目に焼き付けておくよ！", "zh": "这样啊……也是。毕竟是难得的机会，\n我会好好铭记于心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0193_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "36e54d1a5cc69472b45e0b22995aefdb4fdff7b3e0be1cf528e642dda9568c05", "ja": "う……。や、やっぱダメ！　みーるーなー！！", "zh": "呜……果、果然还是不行！不——准——看——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
